@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:维护供应商与采</u>\n<u>购安排控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:供应商</u>" as Supplier
participant "<u>:材料</u>" as Material
participant "<u>:采购</u>" as Purchase
participant "<u>:采购项目</u>" as PurchaseItem
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-27办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-27办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Supplier : 核对供货资格(已核实供应商及结算依据)
activate Supplier
Supplier --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Supplier
K -> Material : 提供采购单位(材料及换算)
activate Material
Material --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Material
K -> Purchase : 提出采购安排(需求、供货方、交付条件)
activate Purchase
Purchase -> PurchaseItem : 组织约定明细(数量、单价、单位)
activate PurchaseItem
PurchaseItem --> Purchase : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PurchaseItem
Purchase --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Purchase
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 确认采购及供应商反馈
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-27办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Purchase : 确认供货约定(负责人确认及供应商反馈)
activate Purchase
Purchase --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Purchase
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
note over K,PurchaseItem
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
